00:30:26,976 --> 00:31:09,984
Original integration: compare three new situations without treating
them as one algorithm: a contaminated collapsed patient, a post-
angiography patient with a painful cool hand, and a bleeding trauma
patient with PEA. State the immediate threat, safe assessment,
relevant source and authority, then the observation or handover that
would change the plan. Evidence tables in the compilation group linked
research as supportive, neutral or against; those headings do not turn
every listed intervention into a bedside order, and reading them is
not an appraisal of every linked study. Keep the resuscitation, device
and source timeline truthful.

